      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Imagine 5 students sharing ONE notebook for an exam.\nStudent 1 writes answers for Question 1.\nStudent 2 sits down - sees Student 1's answers still there!\nTests should be isolated. Singleton breaks isolation.",
